      "created_at": "2016-04-16T10:31:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This will be fixed in the next update on Steam/Android, and the one after that on iOS (we had to ship a more critical fix quicker).</p><p>Note: the game does not crash, it becomes unresponsive. A crash is when a program unexpectedly exits. Good to know for future problem reports =)</p>",
